The syntax of counter is\
\
m, n := 0 \
      | 8\
      | S_m n\
\
let's define a \cf2 rank \cf3 function\cf0 , which computes the depth of the counter\
\
rank 0 = 0\
rank (S_0 0) = 1\
rank (S_8 0) = 1\
rank (S_0 S_0 0) = 1\
rank (\cf4 S_(S_0)\cf0  0) = 2\
rank (\cf4 \cb5 S_(S_0)\cf0 \cb1  S_0 0) = 2\
\
we need to distinguish the rank between function and arguments. there are two invariants:\
\
1. max-rank(e1 e2) = max-rank(e1)\
\
2. max-rank(e2) = max-rank(e1 e2) - 1 \
                = max-rank(e1) - 1\
\
